From bc0b21df0f05fdde8c405c8d5597529ee1deadd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:47:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Display menu with chord staff and second voice

Adds an eye button next to Settings that opens a Display dialog with
three options, remembered per device and off by default:

- Chord staff: a second staff under each line with the chords as block notes
- Second voice: a third below the melody, adjusted to fit the chords when
  the diatonic third is not a chord tone (parallel for passing notes)
- Second voice color

The sheet SVG comes from the API, so both are drawn into it in the browser
(services/sheetOverlay) after it is shown, and redrawn from the original when
an option changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0171SfRvSXj6GAkLSV8EKZTr
